`s 2013(b)(4)(B) the Secretary must waive the non-Federal share of the costs` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the tribal organization is financially unable to provide a greater non-Federal share of the costs` OR `providing a greater non-Federal share of the costs would be a substantial burden for the tribal organization`
            THEN JUST TRUE  -- the text says yes: "The Secretary shall waive up to 100 percent of the non-Federal share of the costs described in subparagraph (A) if the Secretary determines that—"
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "shall waive up to 100 percent of the non-Federal share ... if the Secretary determines that— (i) the tribal organization is financially unable ...; or (ii) providing a greater non-Federal share of the costs would be a substantial burden" (a failed "if", marginal reading (a))

