        OTHERWISE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the bar is for "any tribal organization that is granted a waiver under subparagraph (B)"

-- src:188 | The Secretary may allow a tribal organization to use funds provided to the tribal organization through a Federal agency or other Federal benefit to satisfy all or part of the non-Federal share of the costs described in subparagraph (A) if that use is otherwise consistent with the purpose of the funds.
