GIVEN `appropriations to carry out this paragraph are available` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the purchase is for recipients of food distributed under subsection (b)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2013(b)(5) the Secretary may purchase the bison meat` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `appropriations to carry out this paragraph are available` AND `the purchase is for recipients of food distributed under subsection (b)`
            THEN JUST TRUE  -- the text says yes: "the Secretary may purchase bison meat for recipients of food distributed under this subsection, including bison meat from— (A) Native American bison producers; and (B) producer-owned cooperatives of bison ranchers"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the power is "subject to the availability of appropriations" and for "recipients of food distributed under this subsection"

-- src:195 | Subject to the availability of appropriations, the Secretary shall establish a fund for use in purchasing traditional and locally- and regionally-grown foods for recipients of food distributed under this subsection.
@ref s 2013(b)(6)(A) (src:195)
GIVEN `appropriations are available` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2013(b)(6)(A) the Secretary must establish the fund` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `appropriations are available`
            THEN JUST TRUE  -- the text says yes: "Subject to the availability of appropriations, the Secretary shall establish a fund for use in purchasing traditional and locally- and regionally-grown foods"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the duty is "subject to the availability of appropriations"

-- src:197 | Where practicable, of the food provided under subparagraph (A), at least 50 percent shall be produced by Native American farmers, ranchers, and producers.
@ref s 2013(b)(6)(B) (src:197)
GIVEN `it is practicable` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the percent of the food provided under subparagraph (A) that is produced by Native American farmers, ranchers, and producers` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2013(b)(6)(B) the food provided meets the requirement for Native American producers` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT `it is practicable`
            THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the requirement is "where practicable"
        IF `the percent of the food provided under subparagraph (A) that is produced by Native American farmers, ranchers, and producers` AT LEAST 50
            THEN JUST TRUE  -- the text says yes: "at least 50 percent shall be produced by Native American farmers, ranchers, and producers"
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "at least 50 percent shall be produced by Native American farmers, ranchers, and producers"

-- src:201 | In carrying out this paragraph, the Secretary shall purchase or offer to purchase those traditional foods that may be procured cost-effectively.
@ref s 2013(b)(6)(D) (src:201)
GIVEN `the traditional food may be procured cost-effectively` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2013(b)(6)(D) the Secretary must purchase or offer to purchase the food` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the traditional food may be procured cost-effectively`
            THEN JUST TRUE  -- the text says yes: "the Secretary shall purchase or offer to purchase those traditional foods that may be procured cost-effectively"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the duty is for "those traditional foods that may be procured cost-effectively"

-- src:203 | There is authorized to be appropriated to the Secretary to carry out this paragraph $5,000,000 for each of fiscal years 2008 through 2023.
@ref s 2013(b)(6)(E) (src:203)
GIVEN `the fiscal year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`s 2013(b)(6)(E) the amount authorized to be appropriated for the fiscal year` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the fiscal year` AT LEAST 2008 AND `the fiscal year` AT MOST 2023
            THEN JUST 5000000  -- the text says yes: "$5,000,000 for each of fiscal years 2008 through 2023"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the authorization is "for each of fiscal years 2008 through 2023"

-- src:206 | Funds made available for a fiscal year to carry out this subsection shall remain available for obligation for a period of 2 fiscal years.
@ref s 2013(b)(7)(A) (src:206)
GIVEN `the fiscal year for which the funds are made available` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 2013(b)(7)(A) the last fiscal year in which the funds remain available for obligation` MEANS
    `the fiscal year for which the funds are made available` PLUS 1  -- the 2 fiscal years are the fiscal year for which the funds are made available and the next (assumed, fork F-S3)

